// into the pot — any mix of three, three-of-a-kind or three different — and cook
// a bowl. Every topping in the bowl stacks its own little static buff onto the
// finished dish (two slices of pork = double the damage bonus). Hit an exact
// SECRET combo (see RECIPES) and the bowl unlocks a named ramen with an extra
// bonus stacked on top. A cooked bowl is eaten to grant its buff for a number
// of floors. Buff effect keys understood by the formulas: dmgPct, maxHpPct,
// maxMpPct, defFlat, critPct, dodgePct, regen, goldPct, magicPct.
