// ── MINIONS ──
// Autonomous allies summoned by certain actives. Each world beat a minion seeks the
// nearest foe, paths to it, and strikes (ranged kinds shoot from afar). They
// expire after `ttl` seconds. dmg/level scale is applied at summon time from the
// summoner's level and the skill's rank.
// Minion art is referenced directly by kind via MINION_SPRITE (below); these
// stat rows carry no icon.
